        <mxCell id="MBWOlCuzsJIGJNiQjNZO-86" value="The forwarding scheme with fwd from writeback stage to decode stage. The all the rest forwarding is to the execute stage. It doesn&#39;t need the register wd_W_reg after the Writeback stage. This solution can use a free decode cycle time more efficient (if this time exists).&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;In this version critical path dmem -&amp;gt; read_port -&amp;gt; fwd_unit was fixed by offset read logic to&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;before stage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="MBWOlCuzsJIGJNiQjNZO-1">
